<title>USA: FelCor buys Nashville hotel for $10.7 mln.</title>
<headline>FelCor buys Nashville hotel for $10.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>FelCor Suite Hotels Inc said it has purchased the DoubleTree Guest Suites hotel in Nashville, Tenn., for $10.7 million.</p>
<p>The three-story, 138-suite hotel opened in 1988 and is the second hotel acquired by FelCor in Nashville. It purchased an Embassy Suites hotel in 1994.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
